  "published": "2026-06-27T19:53:09.943Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Major Update: Version 12.0.0 introduces security and performance enhancements.\n\n\t\tSecurity Improvements:\n\t\t- Added comprehensive input validation across all public methods\n\t\t- Added CancellationToken support to all async operations for graceful cancellation\n\t\t- Improved exception handling with more descriptive error messages\n\t\t- Enhanced credential validation in AzureTokenProvider\n\n\t\tPerformance Improvements:\n\t\t- Added ArrayPool buffer management for chunked uploads (reduces GC pressure)\n\t\t- Added ConfigureAwait(false) for better async performance in library code\n\t\t- Optimized ListBlobsAsync with async enumerable pattern\n\t\t- Improved memory efficiency in large file operations\n\n\t\tAPI Enhancements:\n\t\t- All async methods now accept optional CancellationToken parameter\n\t\t- Added new validation methods for container and blob names\n\t\t- Enhanced logging with structured parameters\n\n\t\tUpdated NuGet Packages:\n\t\t- Azure.Identity to version 1.21.0\n\t\t- Azure.Storage.Blobs to version 12.29.1\n\t\t- Azure.Storage.Files.Shares to version 12.27.1\n\t\t- Microsoft.Extensions.* packages to version 10.0.9",
